# Unit tests for alarm.c (same format as acceptance.vec).
# Expected outputs were written from the behaviour documented at the top of
# alarm.c, not copied from the implementation.

### high-limit-is-strict
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=600
init 0
s 10 30
s 20 30.001
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@20:30.001
### low-limit-is-strict
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=600
init 0
s 10 10
s 20 9.999
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
